/-!
# The Besicovitch pair condition

Straight measures and the pair condition are public statement definitions, so they live in
`Besicovitch.Statement` beside the other definitions repeated in `Challenge.lean`; keeping them in
the same module, in the same order, makes their elaborated terms coincide with the challenge
copies.  The rectifiability consequences are developed for finite-dimensional real normed spaces,
and the six-point transfer establishes the condition in real inner product spaces.
-/
